{
  "name": "Dragon's Breath",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You touch one willing creature, and choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Poison. Until the spell ends, the target can take a Magic action to exhale a 15-foot Cone. Each creature in that area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 damage of the chosen type on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. </strong>The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: Choose the damage type; the target gains a Dragon's Breath feature to exhale (caster's DC, cast level damage) until concentration ends.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
